# Title: Verclsid.exe Runs COM Object
# ID: d06be4b9-8045-428b-a567-740a26d9db25
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Victor Sergeev, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-09
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
# Description: Detects when verclsid.exe is used to run COM object via GUID
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*/S* AND process.command_line:*/C*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\verclsid.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"verclsid.exe"))) AND NOT ((process.parent.executable:*C:\\Windows\\System32\\RuntimeBroker.exe AND (process.command_line:*verclsid.exe\" /S /C {* AND process.command_line:*} /I {*))))
